      "page": 588,
      "page_kind": "section_start",
      "edition": "wenji-2009",
      "text": "人们在自己生活的社会生产中发生一定的、必然的、不以他们的意志为转移的关系，即同他们的物质生产力的一定发展阶段相适合的生产关系。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx-engels2/02/12.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-critique-preface-base",
      "vol": 2,
      "work": "critique-preface",
      "locator": "《政治经济学批判》序言：经济结构及其上层建筑的定义句",
      "page": 588,
      "page_kind": "section_start",
      "edition": "wenji-2009",
      "text": "这些生产关系的总和构成社会的经济结构……",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx-engels2/02/12.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
